  m_Text: 'Gathering: WASD to walk. Rocks and bushes have Reach 2, so walk up close
    before you click. Clicks from far away do nothing.

    A rock takes 3 clicks
    and drops a red gem (Ore). Click the gem to collect it. A bush takes 2 clicks
    for Wood.

    These break for good (Disappear When Broken is on). Sell buttons
    are bottom right.'
